CodeBuddy Code
=============

This directory contains the CodeBuddy Code mark, taken from the app icon
shipped in the CLI's own npm package.

Package:   @tencent-ai/codebuddy-code
Version:   2.171.0
Path:      dist/web-ui/pwa-icon.svg
License:   the mark is Tencent's; see the note below

    codebuddy.svg    CodeBuddy Code    monochrome

`pwa-icon.svg` draws the mark in white on a dark rounded square. Only the
glyph was taken: its path is copied unchanged into a 12x12 viewBox with
`fill="currentColor"`, which `SvgIcon::rasterize` turns white so the
shader can tint it with the surrounding UI color, exactly as the other
monochrome agent marks in `third_party/lobe-icons` work.

To update the mark, copy the path from a newer package and record the
version here.

The logo is the trademark of its owner. It appears here to identify which
agent is running in a pane; that is nominative use and implies no
affiliation with or endorsement by the owner.
